  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>solving, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5a545b17-7c32-43c3-aca4-7cd77be1d44d-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 116px;\" /></p>",
